<view class="page"><view class="title">隐私政策</view><view class="subtitle">示例零售店 · 更新日期：{{updatedAt}}</view><view class="card space-top"><view wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="title" class="document-section"><view class="section">{{item.title}}</view><view class="document-body" selectable="true">{{item.body}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">隐私联系</view><view class="note">演示项目未配置真实联系方式。部署自己的店铺前，请补充隐私联系渠道。</view></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section">授权与本机信息</view><view class="privacy-status">{{accepted?'已同意当前协议和隐私政策':'尚未同意或已撤回，可继续浏览商品'}}</view><button wx:if="{{accepted}}" class="secondary" bindtap="revoke">撤回信息填写授权</button><button wx:if="{{demo}}" class="secondary space-top" bindtap="clear">清除本机试用个人信息</button><view class="note space-top">旧订单信息不会因删除单条地址而消失。试用个人信息可通过上述清除入口移除。</view></view>
 <button class="secondary space-top" bindtap="terms">查看用户服务协议</button><button class="secondary space-top" bindtap="platformPrivacy">查看微信平台隐私保护指引</button></view>
